# Environment

The agent's shell is running inside a Fedora virtual machine, not directly on
the Unraid host. Treat local commands, local files, packages, services, and
devices as belonging to the Fedora VM unless told otherwise.

The Fedora VM runs on an Unraid host. The Unraid host can be accessed via
`ssh root@mediaserver.local`.

